N13c = N13b (0007-vayu-nfc-n13b.patch) + corrected 2F 19 (FW interface version) table.
Base: hackios-vayu branch vayu-test26 (d15caf0; MiniAppleStockholm.cpp 1f4fe6e8...) + 0007. Apply: patch -p1 in a tree with xnu/files/.
Why: TEST 152455 (hwbyte 0x06, 2F 19 -> 0x0015) logged "phLibNfc_MwFwCompatibilityChkProcess : FW IS TOO NEW".
libNFC_Comet (system-test22 dyld subcache .33): phLibNfc_GetNfccFeatures 0x1f4592adc maps hw 6..8 to ctx[0xaf8],
and 0x1f458f1ec expects version 1 for it (N13 had 0x22, which belongs to hw 0xa2..0xa4).
Default changes: the 2F 19 answer follows the hw byte shown to nfcd; vayu_nfc_fwif=0x15 restores N13b.
Built 2026-11-02 -> /mnt/ramdisk/nfc-out/kernel-n13c.bin sha256 756064a31681e7e2d612708776f35490c02d3e2ef28d24f079633921c26c45c1. Not run on hardware.

